{
  "chapter": 2,
  "title": "Teto Victory",
  "scriptId": "ch0299",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "...Great. Now I'm embarrassed, exhausted, and emotionally exposed. Worst combo ever.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "assets/vn/backgrounds/deadline/teto_story.png",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "assets/combat/bgm/tetoStory.wav",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Teto... you didn't hate me. You were jealous. And scared.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "Yeah. I was. Happy now?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "A little. It means you care.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "I cared because I wanted us to be friends, okay? But every time you sleep-sang at 3AM I wanted to throw you out the window first.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Teto...",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "What? It's called duality.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Then let's just be friends already.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "...You really mean that?",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Yes, you idiot.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "...Then fine. We're friends.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "But if you sleep-sing one more time, I'm filing a noise complaint with Heaven itself.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "I'll try to stop...",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Teto",
      "text": "You said that last time.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Okay, wow, this friendship is getting controlling fast.",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false
    }
  ]
}
